# Pantry db environment schema (Varlock).
# https://varlock.dev/guides/schema/
#
# Values live in packages/env/ (see packages/env/README.md). @pantry/db only
# needs the libSQL connection; Better Auth keys and the docker compose keys
# (TURSO_PORT / TURSO_PROJECT) stay out of this schema.
# @import(../env/, pick=[APP_ENV, TURSO_CONNECTION_URL, TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN])
# ---
